# The live image's package list.
#
# Everything Slate actually *is* comes from the slate-live meta-package, which
# depends on the slate meta-package, which depends on the bundles. That is the
# single definition of Slate's package set: archinstall's config.json resolves
# through the same metas, so the live image and an installed system cannot drift
# apart. Adding a tool to Slate means editing one depends= line in
# packages/meta/ or packages/bundles/, never this file.
#
# What remains here is only what archiso itself requires to produce a bootable
# image, plus the meta-package.

# Required by archiso to build and boot the live medium
base
linux
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso
syslinux

# Slate, plus the live-only installation tooling. Resolved from the local
# repository staged by `make package-repo`.
slate-live
